room chandlery "The Chandler's"
  bg bg_chandlery_wide
  width 2560
  music music_office
  grade "brightness(0.95) saturate(0.85)"
  perspective horizon 200 ref 875 height 430
  walk (120,875) (170,834) (2380,834) (2500,875)
  entry 1500,856
  arrive alley 1600,856

  hotspot counter "the counter"
    area 900,520 900x200
    stand 1350,856
    look "A long counter with a brass scale, a pot of tallow, and a spike of invoices that has not been reduced since the last century."
    open "The invoices are spiked, not filed. It amounts to the same thing at sea."
    use "Unpaid invoices, waiting for a harbour stamp. I could stamp one of these."
    state if act 4
      look "The counter. Every invoice on the spike is stamped PAID now. Mr Tallow has framed the first one and hung it over the till."
    state if chandler_paid = true
      name "the counter"
      look "The counter, lighter by one unpaid invoice. The chandler will sleep better."

  hotspot shelves "the shelves"
    area 300,120 400x470
    nowalk
    look "Coils of rope, bolts of sailcloth, a lantern for every weather, and one shelf of things that look like they were invented on a dare."
    use "Sailcloth. My mother sewed it for a living. She could tell good canvas from bad by the sound it made tearing. I can't."

  hotspot back_room "back room"
    area 2390,60 170x520
    stand 2300,856
    thing
    look "A dark doorway to the back room. Somebody in there is counting something, out loud, and losing."
    talk "I call into the back room."
      talk tallow
    open "I'm not barging into a man's back room. That's how you meet his cat."
    state if act 4
      look "The back room is dark. A note on the door, in Mr Tallow's harassed capitals: GONE TO THE KEEL. CAT IN CHARGE."
      talk "Nobody answers. Mr Tallow has gone to the Keel, and the cat has gone with him, in charge."
        nothing
      open "It's his back room. Even with the cat out, I'm not that sort of clerk."

  hotspot door_out "door to the lane"
    area 20,260 120x480
    stand 240,856
    exit alley
    look "The lane, wet and honest."

  use stamp on counter if act 4
    "Everything's paid. Stamping it again would just be showing off, and Mr Tallow isn't here to see."
  use stamp on counter if chandler_paid
    "One invoice paid is a kindness. Two is a precedent, and Mr Tallow would never stop sending them."
  use stamp on counter
    "I stamp the oldest invoice PAID. “Anything you like, clerk!” The Arcadia's manifest sails out of the back room and lands at my feet. The cat follows, to supervise."
    give manifest
    set chandler_paid
